PRGSTART

//STACK, UNSTACK, SCALE, AND THE TWO ASSIGNMENTS//

SECTION VARS,//A NUMBER, A POINTER AND A SWITCH, BECAUSE STACK NAMES THE TYPE//

DEC COUNT INIT 0
DEC LIMIT INIT 0
DEC WORKPT INIT NULLPT
DEC MARKSW INIT 0
DEC OTHRSW INIT 0

ENDSECT VARS


SECTION MAIN,//ONE OF EACH//

[START] STACK COUNT (NM) ON FSTACK
        STACK WORKPT (PT) MARKSW (SW) ON BSTACK
        STACK COUNT+1 (NM) WORKPT-OF(LCH) (PT) ON BSTACK
        UNSTACK MARKSW (SW) WORKPT (PT) FROM BSTACK

//SCALE IS THE ONLY MULTIPLICATION L HAS//

        SCALE COUNT BY OF(LNM)
        SCALE COUNT BY OF(2*LPT) GIVING LIMIT

//ONE VALUE, SEVERAL PLACES, AND A PLACE THAT IS AN ADDRESS//

        SET COUNT,LIMIT = 0
        SET IND(WORKPT)NM = COUNT
        SET IND(WORKPT+OF(LNM))PT,WORKPT = WORKPT
        SETSW MARKSW = IND(WORKPT)SW & 4
        SETSW MARKSW = MARKSW | 2
        SETSW MARKSW,OTHRSW = IND(WORKPT)SW & MARKSW
        GO TO START

ENDSECT MAIN

PRGEND
